# <type>(<scope>): <subject>   (imperative, lowercase, no period, <= 72 chars)
#
# Types:  feat fix perf refactor test docs build ci chore security revert
# Scopes: dns scanners ai web api ui db workers auth infra security deps agents
# Breaking: add "!" after type/scope and a "BREAKING CHANGE:" footer.
#
# Body: what and WHY (wrap at 72). Skip for trivial changes.
#
# Footer: Refs #N | Closes #N | BREAKING CHANGE: ...
#
# Full rules: docs/conventions.md
